title: Perception State Transitions
story: fever-dream
description: Tests the three perception states and their triggers

---

## Start in normal state

> look
[OK: contains "Receiving Room"]
[OK: contains "Fluorescent"]

## Spectacles trigger perception gate

> take spectacles
[OK: contains "Taken"]

> wear spectacles
[OK: contains "clarity"]
[EVENT: true, type="story.event.spectacles-worn"]

# Trapdoor should now be visible in Corridor
> east
[OK: contains "Corridor"]

> examine trapdoor
[OK: contains "trapdoor"]
[OK: not contains "don't see"]

## Fungus triggers clarity state

> down
> south
> break glass case with wrench
[OK: not contains "bare hands"]

# Need wrench first — get it
> north
> take wrench
> south

> break glass case with wrench
[OK: contains "brass key"]

> east
> unlock cabinet with brass key
> open cabinet
> take fungus
> west

> eat fungus
[OK: contains "clarity"]
[OK: contains "not distortion"]
[EVENT: true, type="story.event.fungus-consumed"]

## Post-fungus descriptions transform

> north
> north
> look
[OK: contains "Corridor"]

# Tiles description should have changed
> examine tiles
[OK: contains "breathe"]
